; Phase 42J - loyalty for sale. The employer (the factor), the target (Vane) and the relationship
; (Rook, the rank peer 42B reserved) are resolved at Vance's hand-in as
; flag.iron_syndicate.finale_<fidelity|offer|rook>. Idrys Vane's own dialogue reacts to Ironhand
; rank; nothing here touches a main-story flag.

